'''Traps''' are the player's tools to defend their treasures from other players. Each mansion is given 3 Guard Doges and 2 Hidden Doges initially; the player can then apply additional traps to increase its security. Each trap requires a certain amount of '''Trap Points''', the player can place at most 12 additional traps and with an accumulation of 35 trap points. The player can get and upgrade traps from Trap chests and daily deals.
